Lemma amb_line : forall (ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6 : word)
    (F : bvmap 5 word) (fc : bv 32) (m : mem) (x nxt sz : Z) (wprev : word) (junk : list byte),
  rw_cells bsegs m x [C8 (wz nxt); C8 wprev] -> rw_cells bsegs m (x + 16) [C8 (wz sz); CB (Z.to_nat (mb_block_size sz - 24)) junk] ->
  0 <= sz -> 0 < x -> x mod 8 = 0 -> aapp x (mb_block_size sz) -> accessible m x (mb_block_size sz) ->
  mem_inv bsegs m ->
  evt bsegs (fun ms' => exists a1v a2v,
      ms' = MS (mkR (wz AMB_RA) sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 (wz ASHADOW_BASE) (wz x) a1v a2v a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 (wz nxt) s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
               F (wz AOPDEL2) fc None m (seg_rom bsegs))
    (MS (mkR ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 (wz ASHADOW_BASE) (wz x) a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
        F (wz AMB_LOOP) fc None m (seg_rom bsegs)).
